/Author (Marc\040Guasch\054\040Pilar\040Ferré\054\040Isabel\040Fraga)
/Subject (Studies\040of\040semantic\040variables\040\050e\056g\056\054\040concreteness\051\040and\040affective\040variables\040\050i\056e\056\054\040valence\040and\040arousal\051\040have\040traditionally\040tended\040to\040run\040in\040different\040directions\056\040However\054\040in\040recent\040years\040there\040has\040been\040growing\040interest\040in\040studying\040the\040relationship\054\040as\040well\040as\040the\040potential\040overlaps\054\040between\040the\040two\056\040This\040article\040describes\040a\040database\040that\040provides\040subjective\040ratings\040for\0401\054400\040Spanish\040words\040for\040valence\054\040arousal\054\040concreteness\054\040imageability\054\040context\040availability\054\040and\040familiarity\056\040Data\040were\040collected\040online\040through\040a\040process\040involving\040826\040university\040students\056\040The\040results\040showed\040a\040high\040interrater\040reliability\040for\040all\040of\040the\040variables\040examined\054\040as\040well\040as\040high\040correlations\040between\040our\040affective\040and\040semantic\040values\040and\040norms\040currently\040available\040in\040other\040Spanish\040databases\056\040Regarding\040the\040affective\040variables\054\040the\040typical\040quadratic\040correlation\040between\040valence\040and\040arousal\040ratings\040was\040obtained\056\040Likewise\054\040significant\040correlations\040were\040found\040between\040the\040lexico\055semantic\040variables\056\040Importantly\054\040we\040obtained\040moderate\040negative\040correlations\040between\040emotionality\040and\040both\040concreteness\040and\040imageability\056\040This\040is\040in\040line\040with\040the\040claim\040that\040abstract\040words\040have\040more\040affective\040associations\040than\040concrete\040ones\040\050Kousta\054\040Vigliocco\054\040Vinson\054\040Andrews\054\040\046\040Del\040Campo\054\0402011\051\056\040The\040present\040Spanish\040database\040is\040suitable\040for\040experimental\040research\040into\040the\040effects\040of\040both\040affective\040properties\040and\040lexico\055semantic\040variables\040on\040word\040processing\040and\040memory\056)
